- _url = confirmation_url(@resource, confirmation_token: @resource.confirmation_token)

- unless @reconfirmation
  :markdown
    ## Complete this step to start using your Nitrous.IO account

    You are receiving this message because you signed up for Nitrous.IO.

    To complete the sign up process, and start using Nitrous.IO, please click the following link:

    [#{_url}](#{_url})

    Looking forward to having you on Nitrous.IO!
- else
  :markdown
    You are receiving this message because you (or someone) has requested to change your email address from #{@resource.email} to #{@resource.unconfirmed_email}.

    If you did not request such a change, you can ignore this email.

    To change your email, please click the following link:

    [#{_url}](#{_url})
